Aetiology of the cosmic safehold

    : re `cosmic safehold` see ../ : The presence throughout the cosmos
      of a safehold fit for securing our long-term survival
    - here I look into the aetiology of the cosmic safehold,
     {here I survey|surveying} the potential theoretic reasons (causes) for its presence
    - [to begin with|initially] the potential causes are obscure,
      but one thing stands out as [immediately] obvious
        - the safehold is physically bound up (entangled) with the larger cosmos
    - now already physics|cosmology has looked into the aetiology of another [such] [cosmically]
      entangled phenomenon, namely the fine tuning of the physical laws, constants and conditions
      of the cosmos for [the support of] life, and sought the potential causes for *its* presence
        ∴ I begin by borrowing [explanantia] from this pre-existing aetiology, as follows

            for( each proposed explanans ⁠C⁠ of fine tuning )
                ⁃ divorce ⁠C⁠ from the explanandum of fine tuning
                    : note : that is all for fine tuning itself, it will not figure
                      as a premise of the present aetiology
                ⁃ apply ⁠C⁠ instead, mutatis mutandis, as an explanans of the cosmic safehold

        - this yields an initial set of potential causes for the safehold,
          [which is] the basis for|of the following
    ─ initial set of potential causes and their premises:
        necessity
            : privately see `^*• .*${same}$` @ `from the field of fine tuning$` @
              ._/01.tale-of-logic_form/._/40.a_search_for_explanations.notes.brec
            : see also `^^multiverse ensemble \+.${same}$`i
        design
            : privately see `^*• .*${same}$` @ `from the field of fine tuning$` @
              ._/01.tale-of-logic_form/._/40.a_search_for_explanations.notes.brec
            : see                 `^^God \+.${same}$`i
            : see `^^multiverse ensemble \+.${same}$`i
        God + design
        multiverse ensemble
            : privately see `^*• .*${same}$` @ `from the field of fine tuning$` @
              ._/01.tale-of-logic_form/._/40.a_search_for_explanations.notes.brec
            : see `^^${same} \+.necessity$`i
            : see `^^${same} \+.design$`i
    ─ further potential causes and their premises:
        multiverse ensemble + necessity
            : re `necessity` see also
            : privately note : here the principal added premise is a necessarily tight coupling between
              a cosmos’s habitability and safeholding capacity, the universal structure of reality being
              such that the set of cosmic properties necessary for the former will in most cases (in most
              combinations of their permitted values) happen also to suffice for the latter
                : cf. `^*-.+the claim: hardly could life exist absent a speed limit on causation$`
                  @ ._/01.tale-of-logic_form/._/60.vetting_their_explanantia.notes.brec
        multiverse ensemble + design
